	And I 

	 will make your descendants multiply as the stars of heaven; I will give to your descendants all these lands; and in your seed all the nations of the earth shall be blessed;
 [Gen. 15:5; 22:17; Ex. 32:13] [Gen. 12:3; 22:18; Gal. 3:8 $]

	The man 

	 began to prosper, and continued prospering until he became very prosperous;
 [Gen. 24:35; [Prov. 10:22]]
